$$I(x)\ge\sqrt2\cdot x\sqrt{\log(1/x)}\Big(1-\frac12\frac{\log\log(1/x)}{\log(1/x)}
-\frac{\log(2\sqrt\pi)}{\log(1/x)}\Big).$$ -/
theorem I_lower (x : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Ioc (0 : ℝ) 5⁻¹) :
    I x ≥ √2 * x * √(log x⁻¹) *
