where $\varepsilon=\frac12\frac{\log\log(w_1/x)}{\log(w_1/x)}+\frac{\log(2\sqrt\pi)}{\log(w_1/x)}$.
-/
theorem eqn_2_6_step (x : ℝ) (hx : x ∈ Ioc (0 : ℝ) 64⁻¹) :
